  "intuition": "Reweight all-pairs by a simple bandpass function on normalized gap emphasizing mid-sized gaps, modulated by instance_obj_range only; removes import and extra instance_log_prob_std for stability.",
  "hyperparams": {
    "geometry_family": "dense_all_pairs",
    "cap_family": "uncapped_full",
